%% Sequence Diagram — Create Patient (happy path) — Logical level
%% QT-CR-03
%% Updated: 2026-05-22 (lifelines = logical components,
%% messages = business actions — no class names, no method calls, no SQL)

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Receptionist
    participant V as Patient form (Client)
    participant API as Patient API (Server)
    participant BIZ as Patient business rules
    participant STORE as Patient storage

    U->>V: Fill in patient information
    V->>V: Check required fields, formats, lengths
    V->>API: Submit new patient
    API->>API: Re-check the same rules on the server
    API->>BIZ: Create patient
    Note over BIZ: Reject if identity card,<br/>email, or phone already exists
    BIZ->>STORE: Save new patient<br/>(initial status: Waiting)
    STORE-->>BIZ: Saved (with new identifier)
    BIZ-->>API: Patient created
    API-->>V: Created (return patient summary)
    V-->>U: Close popup, refresh list

    Note over V,API: If client or server validation fails<br/>→ show error message next to each invalid field
